---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  activePage="about"
  title="About — João Jacinto"
  description="I design products that make things genuinely easier for the people who use them. Senior Product Designer based in Aveiro, Portugal."
>

  <div class="about-wrap">
    <div class="marquee about-marquee">
      <div class="marquee-track">
        <span>ABOUT ME</span><span>·</span><span>SOBRE MIM</span><span>·</span>
        <span>ABOUT ME</span><span>·</span><span>SOBRE MIM</span><span>·</span>
        <span>ABOUT ME</span><span>·</span><span>SOBRE MIM</span><span>·</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">

      <section class="why-grid reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">What is my 'why'?</span>
          <h2>I design products that make things genuinely easier for the people who use them.</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>I believe that every product designer should step into the shoes of their users, and learn from them day in and day out, to truly understand and meet their needs. By doing so, we can empower businesses to create products that genuinely resonate with their audience.</p>
          <p>My enthusiasm is fueled by a strong connection to the product and its people, an in-depth immersion in its development, and a continuous learning journey from user feedback and interactions.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="section-divider">

      <section class="about-me">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">About me</span>
        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="about-col reveal reveal-d1">
            <h3>I'm…</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>An <a href="https://www.enneagraminstitute.com/type-5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Enneagram type 5</a></li>
              <li>An <a href="https://www.16personalities.com/intj-personality" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">INTJ-A</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="about-col reveal reveal-d2">
            <h3>Values</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Awareness</li>
              <li>Creativity</li>
              <li>Precision</li>
              <li>Respect</li>
              <li>Gratitude</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="about-col reveal reveal-d3">
            <h3>Passions</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Product Design</li>
              <li>Music production, drums</li>
              <li>Building with AI</li>
              <li>Gaming, VR</li>
              <li>Football</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="section-divider">

      <section class="journey">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">My journey</span>
        <div class="journey-row reveal">
          <div class="journey-year">2024–now</div>
          <div>
            <div class="journey-title">
              <span class="journey-role">Senior Product Designer</span>
              <a class="journey-co" href="https://www.anchorage.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@ Anchorage Digital</a>
            </div>
            <p class="journey-desc">Crypto/web3 infrastructure. Designing complex systems to support financial institutions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-row reveal">
          <div class="journey-year">2021–2024</div>
          <div>
            <div class="journey-title">
              <span class="journey-role">Senior Product Designer</span>
              <a class="journey-co" href="https://streamyard.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@ StreamYard</a>
            </div>
            <p class="journey-desc">Live streaming platform. Led On-air webinars' UX, research ops, and the company-wide design system.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-row reveal">
          <div class="journey-year">2019–2020</div>
          <div>
            <div class="journey-title">
              <span class="journey-role">Senior Product Designer</span>
              <a class="journey-co" href="https://www.talkdesk.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@ Talkdesk</a>
            </div>
            <p class="journey-desc">Worked on the AI trainer to improve model training workflows for CX agents.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-row reveal">
          <div class="journey-year">2017–2019</div>
          <div>
            <div class="journey-title">
              <span class="journey-role">Product Designer</span>
              <a class="journey-co" href="https://www.namecheap.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@ Namecheap</a>
            </div>
            <p class="journey-desc">Domain & hosting. Designed an in-house support engagement platform from scratch, learning from 200+ agents everyday.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="journey-row reveal">
          <div class="journey-year">2015–2017</div>
          <div>
            <div class="journey-title">
              <span class="journey-role">UX/UI Designer</span>
              <a class="journey-co" href="https://github.com/beubi" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@ Be.Ubi</a>
            </div>
            <p class="journey-desc">Designed a 3D printing tool from the ground up. Designed a land registry and website for a PT municipality.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="section-divider">

      <section class="influences">
        <span class="eyebrow reveal">Roots &amp; Influences</span>
        <div class="influences-layout reveal reveal-d1">

          <div class="influences-narrative">
            <h2>How I got here</h2>
            <p>I started shipping front-end code at 15 — themes for <a href="https://app.hi5.com/get-started" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hi5 (now Tagged)</a>, and MySpace that pulled 50,000+ concurrent users. That early loop of "make a thing, watch people use it, learn from what breaks" became the throughline. I studied IT engineering with a front-end specialisation, then spent the last decade in product design across enterprise SaaS, crypto, live streaming, and AI tooling.</p>
            <p>The dev background never went away. It's the reason I prototype in code when Figma stops being useful, ship my own portfolio, and treat the line between design and engineering as a tool — not a fence.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="influences-right">
            <div class="influences-block">
              <h3>Resources I learn from</h3>
              <div class="avatar-grid">
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://www.nngroup.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Nielsen Norman Group">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/nngroup.png" alt="Nielsen Norman Group" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://stratechery.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Stratechery">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/stratechery.png" alt="Stratechery" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://www.lennysnewsletter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Lenny's Newsletter">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/lennys.png" alt="Lenny's Newsletter" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://paulgraham.com/essays.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Paul Graham Essays">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/paulgraham.png" alt="Paul Graham Essays" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://www.figma.com/blog/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Figma Blog">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/figma.png" alt="Figma Blog" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://linear.app/blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Linear Blog">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/linear.png" alt="Linear Blog" loading="lazy">
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="influences-block">
              <h3>People who shape how I think</h3>
              <div class="avatar-grid">
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dieter_Rams" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Dieter Rams">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/dieter-rams.jpg" alt="Dieter Rams" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://jnd.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Don Norman">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/don-norman.jpg" alt="Don Norman" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://www.juliezhuo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Julie Zhuo">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/julie-zhuo.jpg" alt="Julie Zhuo" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jony_Ive" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Jony Ive">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/jony-ive.jpg" alt="Jony Ive" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paul_Rand" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Paul Rand">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/paul-rand.jpg" alt="Paul Rand" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Maeda" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="John Maeda">
                  <img src="/assets/influences/john-maeda.jpg" alt="John Maeda" loading="lazy">
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="section-divider">

      <section class="tools reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Tools I use</span>
        <div class="tools-row">
          <span class="tool-tag">Figma</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Framer</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Notion</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Linear</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">GitHub</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Dovetail</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Claude</span>
          <span class="tool-tag">Gemini</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="about-cta reveal">
        <h2>Want to work together?</h2>
        <p>I'm always open to interesting projects and conversations.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-accent" href="/contact">
          <span class="btn-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 4h12v9H2z"/><path d="M2 4l6 5 6-5"/></svg></span>
          <span>Let's chat</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</Base>
